Gotta throw a shout out to there.

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.820
Cause it's a, it's a pretty interesting game otherwise too.

00:21:34.040 --> 00:21:39.200
That's the, that's the one where like, as you get, uh, as you see crazy things in the

