just like keep paying attention, make sure you keep feeding your character.

00:25:55.700 --> 00:26:01.780
But, um, but yeah, it's just not enough to, to really justify it for me today.

00:26:02.080 --> 00:26:07.140
A completely different game, but also a side scrolling game.

