And, uh, you'll be doing a lot of, uh, not just switching, but also like changing your

00:26:48.020 --> 00:26:49.420
spells and stuff like that.

00:26:49.520 --> 00:26:52.180
You're spending a lot of time inside this menu.

00:26:52.620 --> 00:26:56.700
And I was trying to think about, and I didn't actually have an answer for this one because

